I have a variable for which each observation has an associated standard deviation. I would like to run a logistic regression with this variable as a predictor.
I was wandering if I can use the weights option weight =precision=1/(sd**2) in order to incorporate the uncertainty about this covariate. So my weights would be a variable in the dataset defining the precision about the predictor.
Thank you,
Georgiana

